{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_08_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2d6ef78177ee9491c50846307bd95393888dd4e7e64de98ddbf62cbb4a0bab31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:978eaf62788d8333efc263ece7e517eb96d40a32b47c5dc1bee6247e22f53b7f",
      "text": "这里就是大家的座位了。\n因为我的倒霉让大家久等了，对不起啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c7a67db67aeb009d4e2fdbfeeb9aaa666af0c023432535a4bf6a0b625106b2",
      "text": "没关系的！跑着过来找我们的\n龙君，超级帅气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c70a3465873bbf9f2162eefc95ccfcada1a74b43676b8d2093f0513d8bb095",
      "text": "就是说啊。而且，\n能这么近跟龙先生说话太高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87dac2673938b3ddf6eedf0ba6f863341d6a22475e3ac18c879824021a4837f",
      "text": "突然听说“力量部门”取消了，\n本来还觉得很遗憾……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a7b9dc47811a30a08d2d2755a0af7c7e07beee97b31d13951f53069c1dad8e9",
      "text": "多亏了龙先生，反而变成了幸运的事！\n很期待正式演出，请加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145a44542ecac210e98462f81e15c0fd375b1d36833e39c2fc6f0dd3082b39c6",
      "text": "……我的倒霉，变成了大家的幸运？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24efb2ede510e23f6eb8641d507d79cec532bd5467a70c7de41b0b0e14a65e87",
      "text": "太好了呢，龙。多亏了你，\n演出开始前大家就已经喜笑颜开了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:381875bc8dee95959d2d621e2467b5ca7c6fe115e2591ba9a8b1fb4a364bb82f",
      "text": "只要有一点契机，\n厄运也能转变为幸运。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ce4bd35a690b2c756db77edbd0a99dc522aefa499d1c103e5093b34db981ff",
      "text": "就算有时很难扭转，\n只要大家一起承担，就没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00a0ebb629d70135af155600883c4b33d674d6be3992ae5e1d00619b4446a266",
      "text": "我们每天在训练中强健体魄，\n就是为了这种时候啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887dbe66764160c341ceeb13a7ab0d6c09a4c8e873e2fe4c748ccad4130947ec",
      "text": "没错，龙。\n所以，别那么沮丧了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd4cc90c2e68c688983648695d01356a8d75b5c85104fc5a4b61f80020f15ffb",
      "text": "接下来要用舞台表演，\n让全场都绽放笑容，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5513e3cd60e438b366a2ad8d0630817e8f9461fa268cd50d235655d2f5ac170e",
      "text": "英雄先生、诚司先生……好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
